YOU ARE RARE--

1859
00:39:57,664 --> 00:39:58,932
A GIRL THAT CAN LOOK LIKE THIS,

1860
00:39:58,932 --> 00:40:01,902
SO WARM AND SO FRIENDLY,

1861
00:40:01,902 --> 00:40:02,936
BUT THEN TO BE ABLE

1862
00:40:02,936 --> 00:40:03,937
TO GO... (growls)

1863
00:40:03,937 --> 00:40:04,905
AT THE SAME TIME.

1864
00:40:04,905 --> 00:40:07,674
BUT WE WANT TO FEEL IT HERE.

1865
00:40:07,674 --> 00:40:08,675
>> OKAY.

1866
00:40:08,675 --> 00:40:09,543
>> OKAY?

1867
00:40:09,543 --> 00:40:10,310
>> THANKS, TYRA.

1868
00:40:10,310 --> 00:40:11,878
(crying) I'M KIND OF CONFUSED

1869
00:40:11,878 --> 00:40:12,646
WITH WHY TYRA

1870
00:40:12,646 --> 00:40:15,415
SAID I WASN'T STRONG ENOUGH

1871
00:40:15,415 --> 00:40:17,450
BECAUSE I KNOW

1872
00:40:17,450 --> 00:40:18,785
I'M--I'M

1873
00:40:18,785 --> 00:40:20,120
AN EMOTIONAL PERSON,

1874
00:40:20,120 --> 00:40:21,388
BUT I-I'M DEFINITELY PROUD

1875
00:40:21,388 --> 00:40:24,157
OF MYSELF.

1876
00:40:24,157 --> 00:40:24,925
THIS HAS BEEN

1877
00:40:24,925 --> 00:40:26,860
SUCH AN AMAZING EXPERIENCE,

1878
00:40:26,860 --> 00:40:28,428
AND NOW I HAVE, LIKE,

1879
00:40:28,428 --> 00:40:30,130
THE CONFIDENCE, LIKE,

1880
00:40:30,130 --> 00:40:31,431
REALLY TAKE RISKS,

1881
00:40:31,431 --> 00:40:32,699
AND I KNOW I CAN SUCCEED.

1882
00:40:32,699 --> 00:40:34,834
I JUST WISH I WOULD'VE BEEN

1883
00:40:34,834 --> 00:40:35,769
MORE CONSISTENT

1884
00:40:35,769 --> 00:40:37,304
WITH MY PHOTOGRAPHS.

1885
00:40:37,304 --> 00:40:40,840
AND I WOULD'VE BEEN TOP TWO.

1886
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:41,608
THANKS. THANKS.

1887
00:40:41,608 --> 00:40:45,679
>> (whispers) YOU'RE WELCOME.

1888
00:40:45,679 --> 00:40:46,680
>> (laughs)

1889
00:40:46,680 --> 00:40:47,614
>> (laughs)

1890
00:40:47,614 --> 00:40:48,481
>> SO NEXT WEEK

1891
00:40:48,481 --> 00:40:49,382
YOU'RE GONNA BE SHOOTING

1892
00:40:49,382 --> 00:40:50,817
YOUR "BEAUTY IN VOGUE" SPREAD.

1893
00:40:50,817 --> 00:40:51,918
YOU'RE ALSO GONNA BE DOING

1894
00:40:51,918 --> 00:40:53,920
YOUR COVERGIRL PHOTO

1895
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:55,522
AND YOUR COMMERCIAL.

1896
00:40:55,522 --> 00:40:56,289
LATER, THE WINNER

1897
00:40:56,289 --> 00:40:57,624
OF "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"

1898
00:40:57,624 --> 00:40:58,325
WILL SHOOT

1899
00:40:58,325 --> 00:40:59,559
HER ITALIAN "VOGUE" SPREAD.

1900
00:40:59,559 --> 00:41:00,660
AND, UM, I'M SO PROUD

1901
00:41:00,660 --> 00:41:02,329
OF BOTH OF YOU GUYS.

1902
00:41:02,329 --> 00:41:03,263
GOOD LUCK.

1903
00:41:03,263 --> 00:41:04,264
>> THANK YOU.

1904
00:41:04,264 --> 00:41:05,265
>> OKAY, BYE.

1905
00:41:05,265 --> 00:41:06,399
>> OH, MY GOD.

1906
00:41:06,399 --> 00:41:08,568
>> AAH!

1907
00:41:08,568 --> 00:41:11,771
♪♪♪♪♪

